{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12707","headline":"窊尊诗 · 元结","name":"窊尊诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巉巉小山石，数峰对窊亭。\n窊石堪爲樽，状类不可名。\n巡回数尺间，如见小蓬瀛。\n尊中酒初涨，始有岛屿生。\n岂无日观峰，直下临沧溟。\n爱之不觉醉，醉卧还自醒。\n醒醉在尊畔，始爲吾性情。\n若以形胜论，坐隅临郡城。\n平湖近阶砌，近山复青青。\n异木几十株，林条冒檐楹。\n盘根满石上，皆作龙蛇形。\n酒堂贮酿器，户牖皆罂缾。\n此尊可常满，谁是陶渊明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}